      "title": {
        "en": "FFC or FPC interface",
        "zh": "FFC或FPC接口"
      },
      "copy": {
        "en": "Confirm whether the design needs a flat-flex jumper, printed flex circuit or connectorized FFC harness.",
        "zh": "确认设计需要扁平柔性跳线、印制柔性电路还是带连接器的FFC组件。"
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "en": "Contact geometry",
        "zh": "接点几何形状"
      },
      "copy": {
        "en": "Define pitch, circuit count, contact side, exposed contact length and stiffener thickness.",
        "zh": "定义间距、回路数、接点面、露铜长度及补强板厚度。"
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "en": "Mating connector",
        "zh": "对配连接器"
      },
      "copy": {
        "en": "Use the exact mating connector drawing to check contact orientation and insertion depth.",
        "zh": "依据准确的对配接口图检查接点方向与插入深度。"
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "en": "Fold and dynamic route",
        "zh": "折弯与运动路线"
      },
      "copy": {
        "en": "Identify static folds, bend zones and any repeated motion before choosing the flex construction.",
        "zh": "选择柔性结构前明确静态折叠、弯曲区域及反复运动。"
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "en": "Signal and ground plan",
        "zh": "信号与地线方案"
      },
      "copy": {
        "en": "For high-speed links, define impedance, ground allocation and any required shield layer.",
        "zh": "高速链路需定义阻抗、地线分配及所需屏蔽层。"
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "en": "Assembly acceptance",
        "zh": "组件验收"
      },
      "copy": {
        "en": "Agree circuit mapping, dimensions, insertion/retention and device function checks.",
        "zh": "约定回路对应、尺寸、插入保持及设备功能检验。"
      }
    }
